  "discussions_data": [
    {
      "id": "76d40e47bad1c14883bc96389bab0b3bef2759ce",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2641872652,
          "type": null,
          "body": "For example, this will create .pc's such as:\n```\nprefix=/nix/store/y8vmkfhn3cbp37l3fcbcxx9gw8nljaf9-wireshark-qt-4.4.7\nexec_prefix=${prefix}\nlibdir=${prefix}/lib\nincludedir=/nix/store/615vb26kl5x43nplcfv8jpj3rc5zdxy1-wireshark-qt-4.4.7-dev//nix/store/615vb26kl5x43nplcfv8jpj3rc5zdxy1-wireshark-qt-4.4.7-dev/include\nsharedlibdir=${libdir}\nplugindir=${libdir}/wireshark/plugins/4.4\n```\nWhen we want:\n```\nprefix=/nix/store/y8vmkfhn3cbp37l3fcbcxx9gw8nljaf9-wireshark-qt-4.4.7\nexec_prefix=${prefix}\nlibdir=${prefix}/lib\nincludedir=/nix/store/615vb26kl5x43nplcfv8jpj3rc5zdxy1-wireshark-qt-4.4.7-dev/include\nsharedlibdir=${libdir}\nplugindir=${libdir}/wireshark/plugins/4.4\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 2139733,
            "username": "jonringer117",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jon Ringer",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/232a9da2399a35e4051c9575e689ba0df51d8340b9340e83a2409543a1d4baa2?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/jonringer117"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-07-21T16:38:14.272Z",
